<p>Each of our captains runs his own business and collects reviews on its Google profile: Gatorbacks Fishing Charters (Capt. Ashmore) 68, FG Charters (Capt. Gonzalez) 37, Barotrauma Fishing Charters (Capt. Hahn) 10 and Hooked On Tampa Bay (Capt. Pruner) 6. Charter Fishing Tampa Bay has 12 of its own. Counts as of November 2026.</p>

<h2>Capt. Frankie Gonzalez</h2>
<p>Inshore, nearshore, shark, tarpon and crappie. <a href="/about/#gonzalez">About Capt. Gonzalez</a></p>
<blockquote><p>"Captain Frankie provided an outstanding fishing experience for my family.  He went above and beyond to make our trip outstanding.  Created  memories that will last a lifetime. 80 pound bull shark landed and a big one that got away!"<br><strong>Jason P., April 2026</strong></p></blockquote>
<blockquote><p>"We booked a last minute fishing trip two days before Christmas and had a great time! Caught enough fish to feed the whole family for Christmas dinner"<br><strong>Xella D., December 2025</strong></p></blockquote>
<blockquote><p>"Best Captain on the Bay. We had a great charter with Frankie on our vacation and caught so many fish. Even got to take 11 fish home to eat. Thank you Frankie! We will be back"<br><strong>Betty S., May 2025</strong></p></blockquote>
<blockquote><p>"We went out this weekend with Frankie on our vacation to Clearwater. You can tell Frankie knows the bay like the back of his hand, as he shared with us that he was born and raised in the area. We had a blast and caught so many fish we lost count with 11 being keepers. Thank you Captain Frankie for filling our freezer and giving us great memories."<br><strong>Kim H., May 2025</strong></p></blockquote>
<blockquote><p>"Captain Frankie with FG Charters gave us an unforgettable day on the water! He took me and my two nephews out fishing, and we had an absolute blast. Not only is he super knowledgeable and professional, but he's also great with kids and kept them engaged and excited the whole time. We ended up catching over 80 fish! It was non-stop action, and the boys haven't stopped talking about it since. If you're looking for a top-notch fishing experience, look no further. FG Charters is the real deal. Thanks, Captain Frankie!"<br><strong>Kyle N., April 2025</strong></p></blockquote>
<blockquote><p>"Captain Frankie gave us a fantastic day on the water! My teenage son and I booked a charter in Tampa Bay and had a blast—we each caught 6 fish, released most, but kept a couple nice ones. Frankie's boat is super comfortable, and he knew exactly where to go for the best chances. He's friendly, easygoing, and made the experience fun and stress-free for both of us. It's clear he loves what he does, and it shows in how much effort he puts into making the trip great. We'll definitely be booking again next time we're in Florida!"<br><strong>Nataliya D., April 2025</strong></p></blockquote>
<blockquote><p>"Fishing Adventure from Minnesota to Florida! We had an incredible fishing trip, thanks to Captain Frankie! From start to finish, Captain Frankie showed us the ropes and made the experience one our kids will never forget. The kids loved every moment, and we were able to catch some amazing fish along the way. Frankie's expertise and friendly approach made the whole trip enjoyable for everyone. Highly recommend this adventure for anyone looking to make lasting memories. Thumbs up!!"<br><strong>Kelly L., April 2025</strong></p></blockquote>
<blockquote><p>"Went out today with Frankie at FG Charters and had an epic day….after getting tired of catching Redfish, I finally got my first legal slot snook in 7 years!!! Always a great time at FG Charters"<br><strong>Dennis R., April 2025</strong></p></blockquote>
<blockquote><p>"Extremely knowledgeable captain. We've been out multiple times with capt Frankie. He has us on our targeted species on every trip. Friendly and accommodating."<br><strong>Brooksville Logistics, April 2025</strong></p></blockquote>
<blockquote><p>"Hands down the best fishing charter! Frankie was great and my son is super happy. Highly recommended."<br><strong>Samar, April 2025</strong></p></blockquote>
<blockquote><p>"Went on a trip with Captain Frankie and it was an awesome day on the water.  Caught lots of fish.  Captain was attentive and helpful and a hard worker .  Captain worked hard to keep us on active fish.  Would highly recommend.  Captain was definitely dialed in on the fish.   Five  Stars!"<br><strong>Jon L., 2026</strong></p></blockquote>
<blockquote><p>"Absolutely recommend booking with FG charters! You're going to catch fish when out with Frankie, he knows what he's doing and will get you set up and hookin up fish in no time. We had a great time out on the water thanks to Frankie."<br><strong>Ashley H., 2026</strong></p></blockquote>
<blockquote><p>"Had a great time.  Frankie put us on to a lot of fish.  Caught a ton of grunts and some grouper.  He is very knowledgeable, helpful  and friendly.   Truly enjoys his job which makes for a great experience."<br><strong>Dawn R., 2026</strong></p></blockquote>
<blockquote><p>"5 star! Great experience! Frankie is very knowledgeable and puts you on the fish, will definitely book again."<br><strong>Kly, December 2024</strong></p></blockquote>

